[{"client_msg_id":"10c468e1-1e49-41a0-8439-2f4f4ec859cf","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"FX戦士くるみちゃんと聞いて","ts":"1617285138.381500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eqO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"DBC68B5E-5821-4B4E-B8B9-6375E4F885E4","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"まぁでも更に円安が加速する流れも十分ありえるから、米ドルに変えておこうかな。","ts":"1617285123.381200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FqE9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D5E40BF4-B6AE-4414-A38E-1FFD19FB4E2D","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"さて、子供が寝たのでまじめに考えよう。\n前は米国株/ETF買おうと思ってたんですけど、円が急激に安くなってて、（少し円高に戻るかもしれないから）ドルを買うのを少し躊躇してるんですよね。","ts":"1617284970.379800","edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1617285028.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a+g7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2ab7164-d92e-45a5-bda1-ca690440080f","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"個別株よりは投信/ETFかなあ","ts":"1617281855.376500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JTiex"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0054f063-0e69-4f57-badf-bd409e5d92b7","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"株で稼ぐには資金力が無いと難しそうでなかなか手を出せない(一応投資用口座だけは持っている)","ts":"1617281167.375900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VJB0c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31c2f846-a067-4d67-9d33-8b5358ae6c97","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"以前SBI証券開いたので、たしか書面でやった気がする\n今回銀行のがすごい簡単だった","ts":"1617280496.375200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7Klqr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E3ED1B42-129B-4E94-8D2B-1173224D162B","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"SBIのマイナンバーカード登録はかなりつらいとこありますよね。私も結構やられました。アレ途中で諦めちゃう人いて楽天証券とかに流れてそう","ts":"1617280334.374000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"//m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a47af44-95d7-448d-8564-30ad9cf1eaa1","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"マイナンバーカードを、表面正面、表面斜め下から、裏面の3枚撮影しないといけなかったのですが、2枚目3枚目に不鮮明とか枠内に収まってないとかで失敗したら1枚目からやり直しだったのがつらかったです。","ts":"1617279637.371800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CSC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2DB708CB-D153-4B13-B8D2-1A1501974967","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"それ僕もありました。というか、iPhoneからカメラ起動すると、画面だけが固まって何度か適当に撮影したら、ロックみたいなのがかかって郵送になっちゃったんですよね。","ts":"1617278720.368900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sen"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a0fb68c-858e-46fa-ad5d-f7ab8006f7e3","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"この前SBI証券にマイナンバー登録するとき、マイナンバーカードの撮影がなかなか上手くいかなくて1時間ぐらい掛かった。","ts":"1617278349.367000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cKRk5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c4b9db6f-4234-4c9a-b7b0-c74768a790e1","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"(番号で名寄せではなく、銀行の裏できちんと処理をしてですが)","ts":"1617278105.365600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D0w3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aee6de7c-b275-4051-bd87-f25a0fdbf08d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"一応、証券と連携するからSBI証券、SBI銀行両方にマイナンバーは登録処理した...(証券はすでにしてある)\nJNBとスルガとUFJあるけど、基本不要なんだけどどうしようかな...\nいっそ登録したら、同番号の貯金移動は手数料が基本無制限(月2回まででいいので)とかあればいのに","ts":"1617278083.365100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7GMMG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6dea6fd7-1b53-439b-8ae5-1aa3390caa15","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"原作 \u003chttp://demk.net/fxsensikurumi.html\u003e","ts":"1617277954.363200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace